━━━ stdout
Generate schemas, templates, docs and exports

Run with no argument for the full pipeline, or name one or more phases to run only those, in the order given: schemas, templates, vocabs, snippets.

Regenerate editor schemas without paying for documentation: `opentide generate schemas templates vocabs snippets`.

Usage: opentide generate [PHASE]... [COMMAND]

Commands:
  explorer  Write the explorer bundle and search index
  docs      Generate markdown documentation for detection objects
  exports   Export catalogue artefacts
  extract   Import rules from external platforms
  inflight  Inflight preview shard generation and prune

Arguments:
  [PHASE]...
          Phases to run, in the order given: schemas, templates, vocabs, snippets. None runs the whole pipeline.

Options:
      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide generate
  $ opentide generate schemas templates

━━━ stderr · empty
